# Chorus
Meet me in St. Lou-is, Lou-is, meet me at the fair,
C4(2) D4 E4(2) F4 G4(2) E5 C5 G4(2) A4(2) C5 B4(2) A4 G4(3) r(3)
don't tell me the lights are shin-ing an-y place but there;
C4(2) D4 E4(2) F4 G4(2) E5 C5 G4(2) A4(2) D5 D5(2) E5 D5(3) ~D5
we will dance the Hooch-ee Kooch-ee, I will be your toot-sie woot-sie,
